This is one of your strongest academic projects. It should be documented as a **reinforcement learning experimental paper** with sections for problem formulation, Bellman equation, Q-table construction, training process, hyperparameter tuning, results, convergence analysis and limitations.', '', '', '', '/docs/q-learning-grid-world-agent.pdf', 'Academic Project', 'ML Developer', '2026', false, true, 4, null),
  ('coursera-digital-transformation-strategy', 'Coursera Digital Transformation Strategy', 'A digital transformation strategy analysis for Coursera covering AI, data analytics, cloud and EdTech maturity.', 'Academic Projects', array['Digital Strategy', 'AI', 'Cloud', 'EdTech', 'Research', 'Strategy', 'Presentation', 'Data analysis']::text[], '/img/projects/coursera-digital-transformation-strategy.webp', '{}'::text[], '### Project Description

The Coursera Digital Transformation Strategy project analyses Coursera as a digitally mature EdTech platform and proposes strategic improvements using AI, learner analytics, cloud infrastructure, recommendation systems and student segmentation models. Your uploaded Coursera deck identifies Coursera as an EdTech organisation, discusses its digital maturity, proposes datasets and outlines AI/data prototypes for course recommendation and learner segmentation.

Coursera’s own current materials describe it as a platform working with more than 350 university and industry partners, while its Global Skills Report uses insights from 170M+ learners, so this project can be written with strong external context.

### Problem

Online learning platforms must continuously improve personalisation, completion rates, learner engagement, skills alignment and career outcomes. As competition in EdTech increases, platforms need better use of AI and data-driven strategy.

### Solution

The project proposes an AI-enabled transformation strategy based on course recommendation, learner behaviour analytics, student segmentation, predictive dropout analysis, cloud infrastructure and blockchain-based certification ideas.

### Main Features / Analysis Areas

