Dating apps require complex user flows: onboarding, verification, profile preferences, discovery, matching, chat, blocking/reporting and privacy controls. Without good architecture, these systems become risky and difficult to scale.

### Solution

The prototype separates frontend, backend and database layers. Users can create profiles, define preferences, browse matches and interact through controlled communication flows. Admin moderation and safety features can be added.

### Main Features

