  ('blender-animation-vfx-portfolio', 'Blender Animation & VFX Portfolio', 'A creative portfolio area for 2D/3D animation, Blender assets, VFX, video editing and modular game/promo visuals.', '3D / VFX / Animation', array['Blender', 'VFX', 'Animation', 'Video Editing', 'After Effects', 'Premiere Pro', 'Unity assets']::text[], '/img/projects/blender-animation-vfx-portfolio.webp', array['/img/projects/blender-animation.webp']::text[], '### Project Description

Blender Animation & VFX Portfolio is a creative showcase of 2D/3D animation, modelling, visual effects, cinematic editing and production design. Unlike software projects, this should be documented as a **production breakdown portfolio**, showing how assets are planned, modelled, textured, animated, rendered, composited and edited.

### Problem

Creative clients and companies need to see not only final visuals but also the process behind them. A strong VFX portfolio should prove technical skill, artistic decision-making, timing, lighting, camera use and post-production workflow.

### Solution

The project should present finished visuals alongside breakdowns: wireframes, render passes, animation timelines, before/after shots, compositing layers and editing decisions.

### Main Features / Sections

SectionDescription

