Scene mood, shadows, environment

Rendering

Eevee/Cycles settings

VFX

Particles, smoke, fire, energy effects

Editing

Final cut, sound, transitions, colour grading

### Documentation Angle

This should be written as a **creative production case study**, not a normal software report. Add screenshots, render passes, timeline images and before/after comparisons.', '', '', 'https://youtu.be/QxvEu5VFSfU', '/docs/blender-animation-vfx-portfolio.pdf', 'Creative Portfolio', '3D/VFX Artist', '2026', false, true, 13, null),
  ('family-haven-shopify-store', 'Family Haven Shopify Store', 'A UK-focused Shopify pet supplies store with product research, CJ Dropshipping, SEO blogs and paid ad testing.', 'E-commerce / Business', array['Shopify', 'CJ Dropshipping', 'Meta Ads', 'SEO', 'Pinterest', 'SEO blogs']::text[], '/img/projects/family-haven-shopify-store.webp', '{}'::text[], '### Project Description

