### Documentation Angle

Document it as an **e-commerce operations and digital marketing case study**. Include store structure, product research, supplier workflow, ads plan, customer journey and conversion analysis.', '', '', '', '/docs/family-haven-shopify-store.pdf', 'Business Project', 'Store Builder & Marketer', '2026', false, true, 14, null),
  ('vfx-and-video-editing', 'Graphics, VFX and video editing', 'Motion graphics, VFX and edited video for clients, including the animated short "Cars Evolution".', '3D / VFX / Animation', array['After Effects', 'Premiere Pro', 'Photoshop', 'Illustrator', 'Maya']::text[], '/img/projects/vfx-video.webp', array['/img/projects/graphic-design.webp']::text[], 'Animations, VFX, motion graphics and edited digital content produced for clients at Vision Giants and as freelance work, plus graphic design for social content and e-commerce visuals.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2024', false, true, 114, '2024-12-01'::date),
  ('unity-lottery-game', 'Unity lottery game prototype', 'A small Unity prototype with a login flow, in-game currency, betting and coin purchases.', 'Game Development', array['Unity', 'C#']::text[], '/img/projects/lottery-game.webp', '{}'::text[], 'A Unity prototype exploring a simple lottery game loop: user login, in-game currency, number picking and betting, and a coin purchase screen.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2024', false, true, 115, '2024-06-01'::date)
