  ('work', 'Resource Recruiter', 'Right Recruitment', '2025 – 2026', 'Worked in a recruitment and warehouse resourcing role, supporting candidate handling, shift coordination, staff communication and operational workforce planning. The role strengthened my ability to manage people, organise fast-moving work requirements, communicate professionally with applicants and support business operations in a practical recruitment environment.

